From 4cc532d36bb05405716d77bc54ff56efaca3e0c3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.local>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 08:54:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] phase 3: interior pages
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Approach page: three capabilities with deep content (What happens, What
  you leave with, A first week, Duration, Investment). Deep-linkable via
  #assess / #build / #advise anchors from homepage capability tiles.
- Work page: three-column engagement approach (How we start / How we work
  / How we close) + featured Verixar engagement card. Placeholder note
  for more as they close.
- Contact page: two-column layout with contact block on the left
  (booking status, email, location, response window) and 'what to
  include' prompt on the right.

New components:
- CapabilityDetail (sections/) — reusable deep-content block for
  Approach page capabilities
- EngagementCard (sections/) — editorial artefact block for Work page
  featured engagements

Content:
- content/site.ts extended with capability deep-content, engagements
  array (Verixar for v0.1), and contactPrompts.
